OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 6 Oct to Thu 15 OctFA
OL,6,Fband of cloud and increasingly patchy
OL,7,Frain will likely come south early in
OL,8,Fthe period with a ridge of high
OL,9,Fpressure then bringing a spell of
OL,10,Fmostly dry and fresher conditions,
OL,11,Fsome chilly nights possible. Broadly
OL,12,Fchangeable weather patterns look to
OL,13,Fcontinue through to the middle of
OL,14,FOctober with areas of low pressure
OL,15,Fmost likely to pass to the northwest
OL,16,Fof the UK with higher pressure across
OL,17,Fthe south. So further rain and strong
OL,18,Fwinds at times, mainly focused across
OL,19,Fthe northwest, while southern areas
OL,20,Fsee more in the way of dry weather.
OL,21,FTemperatures close to or rather above
OL,22,Faverage on the whole, but still scope
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ffor some unseasonably warm weather
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Facross the south.
